{"name":"Special Delivery","hex":"#a5b2b7","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"special delivery","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A kind of postal service in which, for an extra fee, letters and packages are delivered in a highly expedited manner by a special courier.","A particular posted letter or package which is delivered in this manner; a particular act of conveying such letters or packages to one or more recipients."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/special_delivery"}],"entries":[{"title":"U.S. Special Delivery (postal service)","blocks":[{"text":"U.S. Special Delivery was a postal service paid for with additional postage for urgent letters and postal packets which are delivered in less time than by standard or first class mail service. Its meaning is different and separate from express mail delivery service. Essentially it meant that a postal packet was delivered from a post office to the addressee immediately once it arrived at the post office responsible for delivering it, rather than waiting for the next regular delivery to the addressee."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/Special_Delivery_cover_1897.JPG/330px-Special_Delivery_cover_1897.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/U.S._Special_Delivery_(postal_service)"},{"title":"Special Delivery (short story)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Special Delivery\" is a science fiction short story by American writer Damon Knight. It first appeared in the April 1954 issue of Galaxy Science Fiction and has been reprinted a number of times, in Operation Future (1955), Far Out (1961), and The Best of Damon Knight (1976)."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/Galaxy_195404.jpg/330px-Galaxy_195404.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special_Delivery_(short_story)"},{"title":"Special Delivery (2022 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Special Delivery is a 2022 South Korean action crime film written and directed by Park Dae-min for M Pictures. Starring Park So-dam, Song Sae-byeok and Kim Eui-sung, it was theatrically released on January 12, 2022. The film was screened at the 51st International Film Festival Rotterdam in the Harbour section."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/9/94/Special_Delivery_film_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special_Delivery_(2022_film)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/Special_Delivery_badges.jpg/500px-Special_Delivery_badges.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/Special_Delivery_badges.jpg/1280px-Special_Delivery_badges.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/Special_Delivery_badges.jpg/500px-Special_Delivery_badges.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Special Delivery badges","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASpecial_Delivery_badges.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f2/Running_Messenger_Special_Delivery_stamps_two_types.jpg/500px-Running_Messenger_Special_Delivery_stamps_two_types.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f2/Running_Messenger_Special_Delivery_stamps_two_types.jpg/500px-Running_Messenger_Special_Delivery_stamps_two_types.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"First Special Delivery stamps (two types)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARunning_Messenger_Special_Delivery_stamps_two_types.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thu